98
00:04:52,060 --> 00:04:56,500
TTIR就是我们的Trydown Intermediate Representation

99
00:04:56,500 --> 00:05:02,399
透过把我们的TTIR下发到我们的TTAdapter

100
00:05:02,399 --> 00:05:05,420
TTAdapter是一个编辑组件

101
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:07,819
